1. Meticulous
Very careful and precise
மிகுந்த கவனமான
She is meticulous about her work.
2. Eloquent
Fluent and persuasive in speaking/writing
அழகாகவும் திறமையாகவும் பேசுபவர்
She gave an eloquent speech.
3. Astute
Clever at understanding situations
சூழ்நிலையை நன்றாக புரிந்துகொள்ளும் புத்திசாலி
He is an astute businessman.
4. Impeccable
Perfect; without mistakes
குறையற்ற
Her presentation was impeccable.
5. Resilient
Able to recover quickly from difficulties
பின்னடைவிலிருந்து மீளக்கூடிய
She remained resilient after failure.
6. Ambivalent
Having mixed feelings about something
இருவிதமான உணர்வுகளைக் கொண்ட
I feel ambivalent about moving away.
7. Candid
Honest and direct
வெளிப்படையான / நேர்மையான
She gave me a candid opinion.
8. Tenacious
Determined and unwilling to give up
விடாமுயற்சியுள்ள
Her tenacious attitude helped her succeed.
9. Subtle
Not obvious; delicate or indirect
நுட்பமான / வெளிப்படையாகத் தெரியாத
There was a subtle change in his tone.
10. Pragmatic
Practical rather than idealistic
நடைமுறை சார்ந்த
We need a pragmatic solution.
